    {
      "name": "places/ChIJj7x9wQGLaS4Rai6OpBSAXQ8/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNoN1liM3JRRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Underrated cafe near JGC area. Great ambience, cozy and the music is not too loud so it’s perfect to get your works done. I tried the matcha latte, it was good because hasn’t had the artificial flavor and not too sweet. Also the tiramisu is enjoyable because it has the right amount of sweetness and balance of bitter from the chocolate and the creaminess from whipped cream. Overall, I had an impressive experience and looking forward to come back to this place!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Underrated cafe near JGC area. Great ambience, cozy and the music is not too loud so it’s perfect to get your works done. I tried the matcha latte, it was good because hasn’t had the artificial flavor and not too sweet. Also the tiramisu is enjoyable because it has the right amount of sweetness and balance of bitter from the chocolate and the creaminess from whipped cream. Overall, I had an impressive experience and looking forward to come back to this place!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
